<title>USA: USG Corp Q1 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>USG Corp Q1 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.32     loss	 $0.32</p>
<p> Net profit		15,000     loss	15,000</p>
<p> Revs		     673,000		  602,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  45,946		   45,436</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Noncash amortization of excess reorganization value and reorganization debt reduced net earnings by $42 million, or $0.88 in first quarter 1997 and by $43 million, or $0.93 a share, in first quarter 1996.</p>
<p>EBIDTA for first quarter 1997 was $127 million, compared to $79 million in first quarter 1996.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
